### Aggregator metrics
GET http://localhost:7200/metrics

### Aggregator health
GET http://localhost:7200/health

### Alpha status
GET http://localhost:7101/admin/status

### Force Alpha disconnect. Aggregator must reconnect automatically.
POST http://localhost:7101/admin/disconnect

### Disable periodic duplicates on Alpha
POST http://localhost:7101/admin/duplicates/false

### Enable periodic duplicates on Alpha
POST http://localhost:7101/admin/duplicates/true

### Force Beta disconnect
POST http://localhost:7102/admin/disconnect

### Force Gamma disconnect
POST http://localhost:7103/admin/disconnect

### Pause Alpha without closing its current socket (tests aggregator idle timeout)
POST http://localhost:7101/admin/pause/true

### Resume Alpha
POST http://localhost:7101/admin/pause/false
